  "title": "Watercolour I: Intro to Basics (16+)",
  "summary": "Watercolour I: Intro to Basics (16+)",
  "description": "Register Here Starting December 8! Registration for all Aurora Cultural Centre programs is on the Town of Aurora’s e-PLAY website. All programs continue to be part of the Aurora Cultural Centre. January 15 – March 12, 2026 [SKIP February 19] Thursdays | 6:30 – 9:00 pm | Ages 16+ Aurora Town Square – Shining Hill Visual Arts Studio A 50 Victoria Street, Aurora Formerly known as “Watercolours: Basics & Beyond”, this beginner 8-week program crafted for ages 16+, will introduce you to the beautiful and timeless medium of watercolours. You will learn essential techniques like washes and glazes, colour mixing, palette set-up, materials and more. You will build on a variety of skills each week with different subject matter, supported with demonstrations, exercises, and encouragement. Please note the list of materials to bring to the first class. Materials List",
